  "text": "Fomorians are an ancient and monstrous race. They appear in the tales of a warrior band called the Fianna. An eager man named Abarta wanted to join those heroes. He came to them while he acted like a lazy worker. Fionn Mac Cumhaill took him into service and called him a lazy servant. Abarta led the Fianna onto a weak old horse. The horse carried them away to the Otherworld, where he kept them prisoner. Fionn passed through many adventures and freed his men. Afterward Fionn gave Abarta no place in the band.",
